        "paragraph_id": "6066171B",
        "text": "In this equation, ve refers to the erosion velocity, kl is the permeability, n0 is the porosity prior, nl is the porosity in the sheared zone (keyword pormax) and the parameter A (keyword rheeA) is equal to 3/4 for single particles and approximately 1.7 for a continuum."
