        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 836,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 768,
        "paragraph_id": "2CD1164D",
        "text": "The larger the permeability of the bed, the smaller the dilatancy effect. Van Rhee (2010) suggests using the equation proposed by Den Adel (1987):"
